{"id":"W47f335eb82b6a1818e8559ba","zh":"统计平均谱","en":"","name":"统计平均谱","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W47f335eb82b6a1818e8559ba","text":"统计平均谱","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S0ddd899b63ea17b89da7","source_id":"P116","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"经过与国外常用轨道谱密度分布特征和动力仿真结果进行比较,论证了青藏线轨道不平顺统计平均谱的保守性,结合车辆-轨道耦合动力学理论,提出了轨道不平顺界限谱的动力学制定方法,计算获得了行车速度-动力指标限值下的青藏铁路界限谱及其参数。","citations":[{"source_id":"P116","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S5e02b032bac0734e7af2","source_id":"P116","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"除车体垂向振动加速度外,平均谱代表的线路几何状态对于车轨系统的动力性能还相当宽裕,故而以统计平均谱作为青藏铁路线路几何状态的谱评判标准偏于保守,还需构建更为合理的青藏铁路轨道不平顺界限谱,即车辆-轨道耦合系统在某行车速度下,达到拟定动力指标限值时的最大轨道谱。","citations":[{"source_id":"P116","page":4,"page_end":4}]}],"sources":{"P116":{"id":"P116","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺界限谱研究","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明,陈宪麦,高建敏","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.05.015","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-research-on-track-irregularity-boundary-psds-of-qinghai-tibet-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"由实测谱统计平均得到，用于描述线路基本几何状态。","language":"zh","source_id":"P116","paper_slug":"2018-research-on-track-irregularity-boundary-psds-of-qinghai-tibet-railway","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺界限谱研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W952a015ccc661f7bd69e9dfc","name":"Statistical average PSD","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W952a015ccc661f7bd69e9dfc","name":"Statistical average PSD","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W952a015ccc661f7bd69e9dfc",